## 1. Telugu Alphabet — Vowels (Achchulu)

> Telugu has **16 vowels**. Speak each one clearly and hold the long vowels slightly longer.

| Telugu | Pronunciation | Sound Like | Tone Guide |
|--------|---------------|------------|------------|
| అ | **a** | "a" in **a**bout | short, quick |
| ఆ | **aa** | "a" in f**a**ther | stretch it — "aaa" |
| ఇ | **i** | "i" in s**i**t | short, crisp |
| ఈ | **ee** | "ee" in s**ee** | long — "eeee" |
| ఉ | **u** | "u" in p**u**t | short, round lips |
| ఊ | **oo** | "oo" in f**oo**d | long — "oooo" |
| ఎ | **e** | "e" in b**e**d | short, open |
| ఏ | **ae** | "a" in d**a**y | stretch — "aaay" |
| ఐ | **ai** | "i" in k**i**te | "ai" blend |
| ఒ | **o** | "o" in h**o**t | short, open |
| ఓ | **oh** | "o" in g**o** | long — "ohh" |
| ఔ | **au** | "ow" in c**ow** | "au" blend |
| అం | **am** | "um" in dr**um** | nasal ending |
| అః | **aha** | "uh-ha" | slight breath after |

