|--------|---------------|------------|-----|
| క | **ka** | "ka" in **k**ite | no air puff |
| ఖ | **kha** | "kha" (k + breath) | strong air puff |
| గ | **ga** | "ga" in **g**ame | soft g |
| ఘ | **gha** | "gha" aspirated | g + breath |
| చ | **cha** | "cha" in **ch**air | |
| జ | **ja** | "ja" in **j**ar | |
| ట | **Ta** | retroflex T | tongue curls back |
| డ | **Da** | retroflex D | tongue curls back |
| త | **tha** | "th" in **th**umb | tongue at teeth |
| ద | **dha** | "dh" soft | tongue at teeth |
| న | **na** | "na" in **n**ame | |
| ప | **pa** | "pa" in **p**ark | |
| బ | **ba** | "ba" in **b**all | |
| మ | **ma** | "ma" in **m**ap | |
| య | **ya** | "ya" in **y**es | |
| ర | **ra** | "ra" in **r**un | rolled slightly |
| ల | **la** | "la" in **l**ove | |
| వ | **va** | "va" in **v**ase | |
| శ | **sha** | "sh" in **sh**ip | |
| స | **sa** | "sa" in **s**un | |
| హ | **ha** | "ha" in **h**at | |
| ళ | **LLa** | retroflex L | tongue curls far back |
| క్ష | **ksha** | "ksha" | k + sh blend |

