## Pronunciation Tips Summary

| Sound | How to Make It | Example |
|-------|----------------|---------|
| **aa** | Open mouth wide, hold "aah" | నాన్న (NAAN-nuh) |
| **ee** | Smile wide, say "ee" long | చీకటి (CHEE-kuh-tee) |
| **oo** | Round lips, say "oo" | పూలు (POO-loo) |
| **T/D (capital)** | Curl tongue back to roof of mouth | టమాటా (Tuh-MAA-Taa) |
| **th/dh (small)** | Touch tongue to upper teeth | తల (TUH-luh) |
| **double letters** | Hold the sound slightly longer | అమ్మ (UM-mmuh) |
| **kh** | Guttural "k" from throat | ఖరీదు (khuh-REE-doo) |
| **gh** | Soft "g" with breath | ఘంట (GHUN-tuh) |
| **Rising tone** | Pitch goes up at end | Questions — ఉందా? (OON-daah↑) |
| **Falling tone** | Pitch drops at end | Statements — ఉంది (OON-dee↓) |

