## 6. Casual Questions — How to Ask Naturally

### The 7 Golden Question Patterns

> Memorize these 7 patterns and you can ask almost anything!

---

**Pattern 1: ఏం + verb? (What + verb?)**
- ఏం చేస్తున్నావు? — "AYM CHAYS-toon-naa-voo?" → What are you doing?
- ఏం తింటావు? — "AYM TIN-taa-voo?" → What will you eat?
- ఏం చెప్పాడు? — "AYM CHEP-paa-doo?" → What did he say?
- ఏం జరిగింది? — "AYM juh-REE-gin-dee?" → What happened?

---

**Pattern 2: ఎక్కడ + verb? (Where + verb?)**
- ఎక్కడ ఉన్నావు? — "EK-kuh-duh oon-NAA-voo?" → Where are you?
- ఎక్కడ కొన్నావు? — "EK-kuh-duh KON-naa-voo?" → Where did you buy it?
- ఎక్కడికి వెళ్తున్నావు? — "EK-kuh-dee-kee vel-TOON-naa-voo?" → Where are you going?

---

**Pattern 3: ఎప్పుడు + verb? (When + verb?)**
- ఎప్పుడు వస్తావు? — "EP-poo-doo vus-TAA-voo?" → When will you come?
- ఎప్పుడు వెళ్ళావు? — "EP-poo-doo vel-LAA-voo?" → When did you go?
- ఎప్పుడు తెలిసింది? — "EP-poo-doo teh-lee-SIN-dee?" → When did you find out?

---

**Pattern 4: ఎందుకు + verb? (Why + verb?)**
- ఎందుకు వెళ్ళావు? — "EN-doo-koo vel-LAA-voo?" → Why did you go?
- ఎందుకు రాలేదు? — "EN-doo-koo raa-LAY-doo?" → Why didn't you come?
- ఎందుకు చెప్పలేదు? — "EN-doo-koo CHEP-puh-LAY-doo?" → Why didn't you tell me?

---

**Pattern 5: ఎలా + verb? (How + verb?)**
- ఇది ఎలా చేశావు? — "EE-dee ay-LAA CHAY-shaa-voo?" → How did you do this?
- ఇక్కడికి ఎలా వచ్చావు? — "IK-kuh-dee-kee ay-LAA vuh-CHHAA-voo?" → How did you come here?
- ఎలా ఉన్నావు? — "ay-LAA oon-NAA-voo?" → How are you?

---

**Pattern 6: ఎంత / ఎన్ని? (How much / How many?)**
- ఎంత అయింది? — "EN-tuh eye-IN-dee?" → How much did it cost?
- ఎన్ని సార్లు వెళ్ళావు? — "EN-nee saar-loo vel-LAA-voo?" → How many times did you go?
- ఎంత సేపు ఉన్నావు? — "EN-tuh SAY-poo oon-NAA-voo?" → How long were you there?

---

**Pattern 7: వా? at end = Yes/No question**
- వస్తావా? — "vus-TAA-vaa?" → Will you come? (yes/no)
- తిన్నావా? — "TIN-naa-vaa?" → Did you eat? (yes/no)
- చూశావా? — "CHOO-shaa-vaa?" → Did you see? (yes/no)
- తెలుసా? — "teh-LOO-saa?" → Do you know? (yes/no)

