## 7. Negative Sentences

### How to Make Any Sentence Negative

**For present/future:** Add **-లేదు** or change verb to negative form
**For past:** Add **-లేదు** after the verb stem

| Positive | Telugu | Negative | Telugu |
|----------|--------|----------|--------|
| I went | వెళ్ళాను *vel-LAA-noo* | I didn't go | వెళ్ళలేదు *vel-luh-LAY-doo* |
| I ate | తిన్నాను *TIN-naa-noo* | I didn't eat | తినలేదు *tee-nuh-LAY-doo* |
| I came | వచ్చాను *vuh-CHHAA-noo* | I didn't come | రాలేదు *raa-LAY-doo* |
| I saw | చూశాను *CHOO-shaa-noo* | I didn't see | చూడలేదు *CHOO-duh-LAY-doo* |
| I said | చెప్పాను *CHEP-paa-noo* | I didn't say | చెప్పలేదు *CHEP-puh-LAY-doo* |
| I know | తెలుసు *TEH-loo-soo* | I don't know | తెలియదు *teh-LEE-yuh-doo* |
| I am here | ఉన్నాను *oon-NAA-noo* | I am not here | లేను *LAY-noo* |

